OL,3,AUK sanctions firms over Israeli West
OL,4,ABank settlements
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe construction of settlements, which
OL,7,Fare illegal under international law,
OL,8,Fhas risen sharply in recent years.
OL,9,FSettler attacks on Palestinians and
OL,10,Ftheir property have also surged.
OL,12,FIsraeli Foreign Minister Gideon Saar
OL,13,Fcalled the sanctions a "hostile act
OL,14,Ftargeting private, law-abiding
OL,15,Fcompanies".
